<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 233 0 R /Rect [ 85.199997 398.645968 510.396973 745.222964 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure2) /TU (Concentric circle diagram titled "Socio-ecosophere in Gaza \(August 2025\)" illustrating various systems. The outermost circle, "Geo-Political system," indicates discarded international laws and lack of protection for children. "Chronosystem" highlights historical conflict and trauma. "Macrosystem" shows destroyed infrastructure and absent policy. "Exosystem" represents decimated social supports. "Mesosystem" refers to fractured systems by destruction scale. "Microsystem" features families and essential services under attack, culminating in "Egregious violations of children's rights.") /Type /Annot >>
